UID:10005325-1789895700-1789898400@uuasheville.org
SUMMARY:9:15 Contemplative Service
DESCRIPTION:At 9:15 AM\, we have a 40-45 minute Contemplative Service. This service invites participants into a reflective\, more meditative space\, and includes silence\, beautiful recorded music and videos\, and opportunities for sharing. It also features the sermon and theme which will be the focus in the second service at 11:15 AM. This service is not livestreamed.\, and it include childcare but not a full religious education program. This service will be particularly good if you need quiet in order to hear well or focus\, would prefer a little more space around you\, or seek a more contemplative communal experience. \nBetween services\, at 10 am we will have coffee hour and special programs. Whether you come to the early service or the later service\, we encourage you to consider arriving at 10 am for coffee\, conversation\, and special programs including conversations with the Board\, or Minister & lay-led justice or adult education offerings.  \n  \nContact: Rev. Audette\nEmail: revaudette@uuasheville.org \nCalendarWiz export on Aug 27\, 2026
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/915-contemplative-service-2/
LOCATION:*1 Sanctuary\, 1 Edwin Place\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:**Worship - LITURGY
END:VEVENT
