SUMMARY:Orientation for the Congregational Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Are you curious about the UU Asheville congregational retreat at The Mountain (October 9-11\, 2026)? Or are you already registered? Please attend this orientation and information session. We will describe the weekend\, review the schedule highlights\, answer questions\, review the rules and packing list\, and give people time to make carpool connections. After the presentation\, you will get to sign up for workshops. \nQuestions? Contact Anna Martin
